     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Hello,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">I hope you are well.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">I am trying to run the following model to model dengue, but I am not getting the desired random effect for temperature, which should look like an inverted U.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Please see formula_1 below for the formula. I have count data, weekly (week_index) and by district(polyid). Temperature is mean temperature for each week for each district. As I was getting errors that the temperature data are too close to each other, I have rounded them. The offset is the log population of each district. The week effect is replicated at the province level (one admin level higher than district).</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">I first ran the model with diagonal = 1000 to get starting values, as was suggested in previous posts. In this model, the output looks somewhat like an inverted U shape. When I then re-ran the model using the first model as starting values, the output looks completely wrong – with a somewhat of a linear relationship with a sudden increase at higher temperatures. I have included the inla calls below.</span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">I am not sure what might be wrong or how to proceed from here. </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Any advice is much appreciated.</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Many thanks,</span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Yalda</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">#priors</span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">hyper.ar1 = list(theta1 = list(prior=&#39;pc.prec&#39;, param=c(0.5, 0.01)),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                 rho = list(prior=&#39;pc.cor0&#39;, param = c(0.5, 0.5)))</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://hyper3.rw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://hyper3.rw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792434940082000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dzJwkESng2afCBFPyy8Ot\">hyper3.rw</a> = list(prec = list(prior=&#39;pc.prec&#39;, param=c(1, 0.01))) </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:11pt\">hyper.bym2 = list(theta1 = list(prior=&quot;pc.prec&quot;, param=c(0.1, 0.01)),</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                  theta2 = list(prior=&quot;pc&quot;, param=c(0.5, 0.5)))</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">#formula</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">formula_1 &lt;-  count ~ 1 +</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  offset(logpop) +</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    f(week_index, model=&#39;ar1&#39;, hyper=hyper.ar1, constr=FALSE, replicate=provx) +<br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">  f(round(temp, 1), model=&#39;rw2&#39;, hyper=</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\"><a href=\"http://hyper3.rw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://hyper3.rw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792434940082000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dzJwkESng2afCBFPyy8Ot\">hyper3.rw</a> </span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">, constr=T, scale.model = T) + </span><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">  f(polyid, model=&#39;bym2&#39;, graph=g,  scale.model=TRUE, adjust.for.con.comp=TRUE, hyper=hyper.bym2)</span> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">starting.value &lt;- INLA::inla(</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  formula_1,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  data,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  family = &quot;zeroinflatedpoisson1&quot;,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  # fixed effects calibration</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.fixed = list(mean.intercept=0,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                       prec.intercept=1,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                       mean=0,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                       prec=1),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  # save predicted values on response scale</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.predictor = list(compute=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                           link=1),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  # items to compute</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.compute = list(cpo=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         waic=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         dic=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         config=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         return.marginals.predictor=TRUE ),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  <span lang=\"FR\"># configure inla approx</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">  control.inla = list(int.strategy = &#39;eb&#39;,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">                      strategy=&#39;gaussian&#39;,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">                      cmin=0,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">  </span>diagonal = 1000),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">   inla.mode = &quot;experimental&quot;, </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  verbose = TRUE</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">)</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">inla_result &lt;- INLA::inla(</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  formula_1,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  data,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  family = &quot;zeroinflatedpoisson1&quot;,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  # fixed effects calibration</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.fixed = list(mean.intercept=0,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                       prec.intercept=1,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                       mean=0,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                       prec=1),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">   </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  # save predicted values on response scale</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.predictor = list(compute=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                           link=1),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  # items to compute</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.compute = list(cpo=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         waic=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         dic=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         config=TRUE,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">                         return.marginals.predictor=TRUE ),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">    </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  <span lang=\"FR\"># configure inla approx</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">  control.inla = list(int.strategy = &#39;eb&#39;,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">                      strategy=&#39;adaptive&#39; ,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"FR\">                      cmin=0</span>),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  control.mode = list(result = starting.value, restart = TRUE),</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  inla.mode = &quot;experimental&quot;,</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">  verbose = TRUE</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:15.6933px;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">)</p>"
